commit a38259d0
author: cdvankammen
date: 2026-10-22 11:56:24 -0600
subject: feat(observability): track combo fallback chain per request

handleComboChat now accumulates a fallbackChain array — one entry per
attempted model { model, ok, status, error?, latencyMs }, oldest first:
- Success after failures: chain attached as x-9r-fallback-chain response
  header (only when fallback actually happened)
- All failed: chain embedded in the 503 error body for client visibility
- New optional onFallbackEvent callback (fire-and-forget, never breaks
  routing) wired from chat.js to log compact FALLBACK lines

Tests: tests/unit/combo-fallback-chain.test.js — 3 tests with real
assertions (chain order/content, header presence rules, error-body chain).
All pass. Caught missing declaration during development.

Part of: Observability & Conversation Analytics plan (Phase P2)


